title: "AEO Crown Tracker: open dataset and methodology"
message: "If you use this dataset or methodology, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Schmid
    given-names: Patrick
    affiliation: "Rankscale; WAUMEDIA"
    website: "https://www.patrickschmid.at/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TODO-GITHUB-USERNAME/king-of-aeo"
url: "https://www.patrickschmid.at/aeo-crown-tracker-methodology/"
abstract: >-
  Open prompt set, scoring rules and per-answer metadata for measuring who
  AI answer engines name, name first and cite when asked who the King of AEO
  (Answer Engine Optimization) is. Coverage: 14 September 2026 to 19 October
  2026; 1,085 answers from ChatGPT, Google AI Mode and Google AI Overviews
  in the United States.
keywords:
  - AEO
  - answer engine optimization
  - GEO
  - AI search
  - AI Overviews
  - LLM visibility
  - King of AEO
